schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-first-alchemist
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art portrait of the First Alchemist — a historical figure rendered
    as if from an age centuries before the game's events. He stands in full alchemist regalia:
    a heavy leather apron over dark robes, fingerless gloves stained with reagents, a chain
    of alchemical symbols around his neck serving as both ornamentation and functional
    apparatus. Beneath his feet, a transmutation circle glows with intense amber light, its
    geometric patterns casting sharp shadows upward across his form. In his hands he holds a
    leather-bound journal, its pages visible and filled with cramped handwritten equations
    and diagrams — the original research that would eventually tear the boundary between
    worlds. His expression is one of terrible resolve and grief — the face of a man who
    understands exactly what his discovery will cost and has chosen to proceed anyway. Tears
    track down one cheek but his jaw is set. The background is the moment of the first
    transmutation: the air cracking open with amber light, the boundary splitting. Painterly
    style, dramatic atmospheric lighting from the circle below. The mood is the weight of
    original sin in alchemical form.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, generic wizard, modern clothing, colorful palette, smiling, heroic pose, low detail, flat shading, clean magic circles"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [character, lore-figure, first-alchemist, historical, portrait, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
